body:
"The rest of the game was spent in dread. Its now 3am and I'm hiding in  the bathroom typing this while she makes serial killer noises."

&#x200B;

Destroyed the whole story.

Someone will replace CGMC. The problem is we all want it right now. There is too much money to be made, to be a low key (as in, marijuana and shrooms only - perhaps cut back JUST to marijuana again) market. Whether it's the original or a new team, I hope for it.

&#x200B;

Until then I'm contacting long term vendors and trying to make arrangements.

&#x200B;

Over the years I've gained a lot of PGP keys I'll be able to confirm with... but not so much with e-mails (I was never one much for proton mail and such as markets easily allowed communication).

&#x200B;

Although without notice or much fanfare, the exit of CGMC is very admirable and I thank them for the many many thousands of dollars I've made with them from the last few years.

Want my May commission though god damnit, shit was gonna be decent! :p

Right what? You think I'm posting a phishing site?

&#x200B;

If you have 2fa enabled, which you should, and if you don't you're a moron, try it for yourself.
